TITLE:: SequencePlayer
SUMMARY:: Plays a sequence of notes from PianoRoll.
RELATED:: Classes/PianoRoll, Classes/Sequencer

DESCRIPTION::
Allows a set of notes displayed in a LINK::Classes/PianoRoll::, for example which has just been recorded from a keyboard, to be played back.

NOTE::
You can run the unit tests for TELETYPE::Sequencer:: by running:
CODE::
(
UnitTest.reportPasses_(false);
SequencePlayerUnitTests.run;
)
::
::


CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Creates a new TELETYPE::SequencePlayer::.

ARGUMENT:: tempoClock
The clock used to schedule playback. Defaults to TempoClock.default.

ARGUMENT:: midiOut
The MIDI output device. Defaults to Setup.midi.

returns:: A new TELETYPE::SequencePlayer:: instance.


INSTANCEMETHODS::
PRIVATE:: prResetPlayingNotes

METHOD:: delta
The beat length of each playback slice (the scheduling grid quant).

returns:: The slice duration in beats (0.25 by default).

METHOD:: init
Initialises a new TELETYPE::SequencePlayer::.

ARGUMENT:: tempoClock
The clock used to schedule playback. Defaults to TempoClock.default.

ARGUMENT:: midiOut
The MIDI output device. Defaults to Setup.midi.

returns:: This instance.

METHOD:: latency
The scheduling offset applied to MIDI events, in beats.

returns:: The current latency value in beats (0.05 by default).

METHOD:: loopEnd
The loop end time in beats.

returns:: The current loop end time.

METHOD:: loopStart
The loop start time in beats.

returns:: The current loop start time.

METHOD:: midiChannel
The MIDI channel used for note on/off messages.

returns:: The current MIDI channel.

METHOD:: onPlayheadMove_
Registers a function called each time the playhead advances during playback. The function receives the new playhead time in beats.

ARGUMENT:: action
A LINK::Classes/Function:: invoked when the playhead moves to the next slice position.

METHOD:: play
Starts playback from the current playhead position.

returns:: A report string from the first playback slice.

METHOD:: playheadTime
The current playback position in beats. Set with TELETYPE::playheadTime_::.

returns:: The current playhead time in beats.

METHOD:: sequence
The array of LINK::Classes/PlayableNote:: instances to play.

returns:: The current sequence.

METHOD:: stop
Stops playback and sends note-off for any currently playing notes.

returns:: This instance.


EXAMPLES::

code::
(some example code)
